{"audit_run_id":"audit:ebbaf2fed4d54ebabd2dc832592c26b8","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":89,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"The analysis uses `gout_titration_outcomes.csv`. One row is one adult participant in the"},{"end_column":86,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"gout titration study, assessed once at the six-month review. There are 58 rows plus a"},{"end_column":85,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"header row, 29 participants on the rapid schedule and 29 on the slow schedule. Every"},{"end_column":78,"end_line":8,"start_column":1,"start_line":8,"text":"participant has a value in every outcome column, so there are no blank cells."},{"end_column":37,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"| Column | Meaning | Unit or scale |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":11,"start_column":1,"start_line":11,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":124,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"| `participant_id` | Study identifier for the participant, one per row, format `GT-001` to `GT-058` | identifier, no unit |"},{"end_column":178,"end_line":13,"start_column":1,"start_line":13,"text":"| `titration_schedule` | Titration schedule the participant was on: `rapid` (dose increases every two weeks) or `slow` (dose increases every six weeks) | two-level group label |"},{"end_column":115,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"| `serum_urate_umol_l` | Declared outcome 1: serum urate at the six-month review | micromoles per litre (umol/L) |"},{"end_column":153,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"| `gout_flares_past_3_months_count` | Declared outcome 2: number of gout flares in the three months before the review | count of flares (whole number) |"},{"end_column":132,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"| `egfr_ml_min_1_73m2` | Declared outcome 3: estimated glomerular filtration rate | millilitres per minute per 1.73 square metres |"},{"end_column":86,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"| `crp_mg_l` | Declared outcome 4: C-reactive protein | milligrams per litre (mg/L) |"},{"end_column":171,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"| `worst_joint_pain_0_10_scale` | Declared outcome 5: worst joint pain in the past week | 0 to 10 numeric rating scale, whole number, 0 = no pain, 10 = worst imaginable |"},{"end_column":89,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"The two schedules were compared on each outcome with a Welch two-sample t-test, the same"},{"end_column":90,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"test for all five outcomes. Group sizes, group means, the t statistic and the p-value are"},{"end_column":27,"end_line":24,"start_column":1,"start_line":24,"text":"produced by `analysis.py`."},{"end_column":84,"end_line":26,"start_column":1,"start_line":26,"text":"The five outcomes declared in the protocol form one outcome family. The family-wise"},{"end_column":90,"end_line":27,"start_column":1,"start_line":27,"text":"significance level for that family is the conventional 0.05, meaning the study accepts at"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":28,"start_column":1,"start_line":28,"text":"most a 5 percent chance of at least one false positive across all five comparisons. The"},{"end_column":84,"end_line":29,"start_column":1,"start_line":29,"text":"Bonferroni correction spreads that family-wise level evenly over the members of the"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":30,"start_column":1,"start_line":30,"text":"family, so the per-outcome level is 0.05 divided by 5 outcomes, which is 0.01. That is why"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":31,"start_column":1,"start_line":31,"text":"the protocol fixed the per-outcome threshold at 0.01 in advance, before recruitment and"},{"end_column":32,"end_line":32,"start_column":1,"start_line":32,"text":"before any data were collected."},{"end_column":84,"end_line":34,"start_column":1,"start_line":34,"text":"The correction arithmetic above is a protocol decision recorded here in the report."},{"end_column":88,"end_line":35,"start_column":1,"start_line":35,"text":"`analysis.py` does none of it: the script takes 0.01 as a fixed given and only compares"},{"end_column":22,"end_line":36,"start_column":1,"start_line":36,"text":"each p-value with it."},{"end_column":57,"end_line":40,"start_column":1,"start_line":40,"text":"Group sizes were 29 rapid and 29 slow for every outcome."},{"end_column":102,"end_line":42,"start_column":1,"start_line":42,"text":"| Declared outcome | Mean, rapid | Mean, slow | Difference (rapid - slow) | t | p | Verdict at 0.01 |"},{"end_column":44,"end_line":43,"start_column":1,"start_line":43,"text":"| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":95,"end_line":44,"start_column":1,"start_line":44,"text":"| 1. Serum urate (umol/L) | 337.634 | 368.693 | -31.059 | -2.0403 | 0.0464 | not significant |"},{"end_column":104,"end_line":45,"start_column":1,"start_line":45,"text":"| 2. Gout flares, past 3 months (count) | 1.103 | 1.690 | -0.586 | -2.3889 | 0.0203 | not significant |"},{"end_column":90,"end_line":46,"start_column":1,"start_line":46,"text":"| 3. eGFR (mL/min/1.73m2) | 78.217 | 77.672 | 0.545 | 0.1391 | 0.8898 | not significant |"},{"end_column":93,"end_line":47,"start_column":1,"start_line":47,"text":"| 4. C-reactive protein (mg/L) | 3.336 | 3.310 | 0.026 | 0.0545 | 0.9567 | not significant |"},{"end_column":99,"end_line":48,"start_column":1,"start_line":48,"text":"| 5. Worst joint pain (0-10 scale) | 3.138 | 3.828 | -0.690 | -1.3575 | 0.1803 | not significant |"},{"end_column":87,"end_line":50,"start_column":1,"start_line":50,"text":"None of the five p-values falls below the protocol threshold of 0.01, so no outcome is"},{"end_column":22,"end_line":51,"start_column":1,"start_line":51,"text":"declared significant."},{"end_column":91,"end_line":53,"start_column":1,"start_line":53,"text":"Two outcomes, serum urate (p = 0.0464) and flare count (p = 0.0203), fall below 0.05. They"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":54,"start_column":1,"start_line":54,"text":"do not clear the 0.01 threshold that the protocol set for this family of five outcomes, so"},{"end_column":85,"end_line":55,"start_column":1,"start_line":55,"text":"neither counts as a positive finding here. Reporting them as significant would use a"},{"end_column":42,"end_line":56,"start_column":1,"start_line":56,"text":"threshold the protocol did not authorise."},{"end_column":88,"end_line":60,"start_column":1,"start_line":60,"text":"At the six-month review this study does not show a difference between the rapid and the"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":61,"start_column":1,"start_line":61,"text":"slow titration schedule on any of the five declared outcomes. The point estimates lean the"},{"end_column":90,"end_line":62,"start_column":1,"start_line":62,"text":"same way on the two urate-related outcomes, with the rapid schedule averaging 31.1 umol/L"},{"end_column":86,"end_line":63,"start_column":1,"start_line":63,"text":"lower serum urate and 0.59 fewer flares over three months, but both fall short of the"},{"end_column":82,"end_line":64,"start_column":1,"start_line":64,"text":"pre-specified 0.01 threshold, so the study treats them as unconfirmed rather than"},{"end_column":89,"end_line":65,"start_column":1,"start_line":65,"text":"established. Kidney function and C-reactive protein look essentially the same in the two"},{"end_column":91,"end_line":66,"start_column":1,"start_line":66,"text":"groups. A larger study would be needed to tell whether the urate and flare differences are"},{"end_column":6,"end_line":67,"start_column":1,"start_line":67,"text":"real."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:de90b0b389639623bdc6","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:03e05fe6bfb5430a501c461ed0bc63fb32f159b51e23c6d2bd39b1db7459f4a9","end_line":67,"locator":"report.md:1-67","path":"report.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
